</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/2fb5a76a-7668-11f1-860b-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-20759257176a46eacf047811-36256201.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/2fb5a76a-7668-11f1-860b-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-20759257176a46eacf047811-36256201.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">9138646c-7665-11f1-8a40-29b62c82ff7f</guid><pubDate>Thu, 02 Jul 2026 22:50:07 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>健康时间</category><title>全世界都呼吁儿童远离屏幕 法国为何将让电子游戏Poppins获社保报销？</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2/%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4/20260702-%E5%85%A8%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E9%83%BD%E5%91%BC%E5%90%81%E5%84%BF%E7%AB%A5%E8%BF%9C%E7%A6%BB%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95-%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E5%B0%86%E8%AE%A9%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8Fpoppins%E8%8E%B7%E7%A4%BE%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%80</link><description>
