</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/76420d32-cc67-11f0-8db3-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/w1024-p16x9-2025-03-10T134731Z-1862672740-RC21DBAKMK1L-RTRMADP-3-ARCELORMITTAL-DUNKIRK-SUSPENSION.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/76420d32-cc67-11f0-8db3-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/w1024-p16x9-2025-03-10T134731Z-1862672740-RC21DBAKMK1L-RTRMADP-3-ARCELORMITTAL-DUNKIRK-SUSPENSION.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">67305824-7475-11f1-b2fc-0d98b9b1e187</guid><pubDate>Tue, 30 Jun 2026 12:58:18 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>艾娃</dc:creator></item><item><category>法国</category><title>法东北部一对夫妇被抓      双胞胎女儿死于严重脱水</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD/20260629-%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%9C%E5%8C%97%E9%83%A8%E4%B8%80%E5%AF%B9%E5%A4%AB%E5%A6%87%E8%A2%AB%E6%8A%93-%E5%8F%8C%E8%83%9E%E8%83%8E%E5%A5%B3%E5%84%BF%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%A5%E9%87%8D%E8%84%B1%E6%B0%B4</link><description>
