</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/9246de74-7269-11f1-b479-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-05-21-j-FMM-archive-Afrique-Francophonie-Marie-Cl%C3%A9mentine-Dusabejambot-Cam%C3%A9ra-d-or-Data-RFI.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/9246de74-7269-11f1-b479-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-05-21-j-FMM-archive-Afrique-Francophonie-Marie-Cl%C3%A9mentine-Dusabejambot-Cam%C3%A9ra-d-or-Data-RFI.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">eca35642-726c-11f1-a608-433b655dc866</guid><pubDate>Sat, 27 Jun 2026 21:23:58 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>尼古拉</dc:creator></item><item><category>法国</category><title>法国9月份开始实施PFAS禁令</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD/20260627-%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD9%E6%9C%88%E4%BB%BD%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E5%AE%9E%E6%96%BDpfas%E7%A6%81%E4%BB%A4</link><description>
